hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19193","Waki narrated to us: Shuba narrated to us: Abu Israil al-Jushami narrated to us, from an elder of theirs called Jada, that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saw a dream-vision for a man. He said: So he sent for him and he came, and he set to recount it to him. And the man was great of belly. He said: So he set to say with his finger in his belly: Had this been in other than this it would have been better for you."
